    "details": "<p><strong>Event Name:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Techashy 2.0 &ndash; 24-Hour National-Level Hackathon</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Organized By:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Beta Labs, the premier technical club of IIIT Kottayam</li>\n<li>Flagship event under Aaroh 2026 &ndash; the annual tech-fest</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Overview:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Techashy is a 24-hour national-level hackathon bringing together student developers, engineers, and innovators from across India.</li>\n<li>Participants ideate, design, and build functional solutions to real-world problem statements within an intense 24-hour development cycle.</li>\n<li>The event emphasizes practical implementation, scalable architecture, and deployable prototypes.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Specifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Duration: 24 Hours</li>\n<li>Mode: On-site</li>\n<li>Venue: IIIT Kottayam Campus</li>\n<li>Team Size: 3&ndash;5 Members</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Problem Domains:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Healthcare &amp; MedTech</li>\n<li>AI &amp; Machine Learning</li>\n<li>Agriculture &amp; Climate Tech</li>\n<li>Smart Cities &amp; IoT</li>\n<li>Education &amp; EdTech</li>\n<li>Blockchain &amp; Cybersecurity</li>\n<li>Social Good &amp; Governance</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>What Participants Will Build:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>End-to-end functional prototypes</li>\n<li>Scalable and demo-ready solutions</li>\n<li>Full-stack or domain-focused systems addressing industry-relevant challenges</li>\n<li>Architects reviewed under live mentorship from technical experts and professionals</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Why Participate:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>National-level competitive exposure</li>\n<li>Direct interaction with industry mentors and recruiters</li>\n<li>Networking with top technical talent across the country</li>\n<li>Potential fast-track recruitment and pre-placement opportunities</li>\n<li>Hands-on experience building under real-world constraints and tight deadlines</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Learning Outcomes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strengthens technical problem-solving ability</li>\n<li>Enhances teamwork and collaboration</li>\n<li>Develops rapid prototyping and execution skills</li>\n<li>Encourages innovation-driven and production-ready thinking</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Techashy is designed to push boundaries and cultivate the next generation of engineers capable of building impactful, real-world solutions under pressure.</p>",
